## 9. WORKSTREAM P1 — METADATA GOVERNANCE AND RUNTIME LINEAGE

### P1-L. Integrate existing governance modules

Map the current relationships among:

- PostgreSQL schema metadata.
- dbt manifest metadata.
- Metadata graph.
